<title>THAILAND: Siam Panich Leasing annual profits rise.</title>
<headline>Siam Panich Leasing annual profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited annual financial results for Siam Panich Leasing Plc for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>			 (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  For 12 months</p>
<p>				     1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   1.50	     1.61</p>
<p>    Net			  202.24	   179.38</p>
<p>NOTES: Fourth quarter figures not stated. Company's full name is Siam Panich Leasing Plc. The company offers leasing and hire purchase financing services.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
